1
00:00:00,764 --> 00:00:01,864
(Penny:)Nothing.

2
00:00:01,865 --> 00:00:03,165
(Leonard:)Hey, what's going on with you?

3
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:04,766
(Penny:)I don't want to
talk about it.

4
00:00:04,768 --> 00:00:06,498
(Leonard:)Well, hey,
come on, just tell me.

5
00:00:06,503 --> 00:00:09,033
(Penny:)Fine.

6
00:00:09,039 --> 00:00:10,669
(Penny:)Lately, I kind
of feel like

7
00:00:10,674 --> 00:00:11,974
(Penny:)you've been taking
me for granted.

8
00:00:11,975 --> 00:00:14,305
Wh-what? Where is this
coming from?

9
00:00:14,311 --> 00:00:15,481
(Sheldon:)Leonard.

10
00:00:15,478 --> 00:00:16,478
(Sheldon:)She might be drunk.

11
00:00:16,479 --> 00:00:19,209
(Sheldon:)All she had was chips.

12
00:00:19,215 --> 00:00:21,045
(Penny:)It's just, since we got married
you seem to think

13
00:00:21,051 --> 00:00:22,851
you don't have to try anymore.

14
00:00:22,852 --> 00:00:25,082
(Leonard:)That is ridiculous.

15
00:00:25,088 --> 00:00:26,688
(Penny:)This is exactly why I didn't
want to talk about it.

16
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,120
(Leonard:)No, No, no, no.
Let's talk about it.

17
00:00:28,124 --> 00:00:29,654
(Leonard:)I'm the one who's made
all the effort

18
00:00:29,659 --> 00:00:31,489
(Leonard:)in this relationship
since day one.

19
00:00:31,494 --> 00:00:33,464
(Leonard:)Please tell me
what more I could do.

20
00:00:33,463 --> 00:00:35,833
(Penny:)Okay. You know what?
Maybe I'll take Amy with me

21
00:00:35,832 --> 00:00:37,632
(Penny:)to the spa this weekend instead.

22
00:00:37,634 --> 00:00:39,764
(Leonard:)Fine, go ahead.

23
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:46,670
(Sheldon:)Amy is free.

24
00:00:48,078 --> 00:00:50,078
(Sheldon:)She had a harp lesson
on Saturday,

25
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,810
but it got canceled...

26
00:00:51,815 --> 00:00:54,385
(Sheldon:)Boy, when you take an interest
in people,

27
00:00:54,384 --> 00:01:00,024
(Sheldon:)you really uncork
a geyser of nonsense.

